  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Monte Alburchia di Gangi. Manganaro, (<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/2533/pleiades/items/MYCSIFWZ/library\" target=\"_self\" title=\"Manganaro 1965\"><em>Archeologia Classica</em>\u00a017:1965, 199</a>) suggests Monte Alburchia as a possible location for the ancient settlement of Herbita, but the hypothesis is not supported in the <em>BTCGI</em> or the <em>Barrington Atlas</em>. The site is the findspot of multiple inscriptions.</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
